sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Popup as Trails Scout Popup
    participant Content as Content Script
    participant Inspector as Injected Inspector
    participant Page as Application Under Test
    participant Locator as Locator Logic
    participant Trails as Trails API

    User->>Popup: Start inspection
    Popup->>Content: Request element inspection
    Content->>Inspector: Inject or activate inspector
    Inspector->>Page: Observe selected element
    Page-->>Inspector: Element context
    Inspector->>Locator: Build locator candidates
    Locator-->>Popup: Locator data
    Popup-->>User: Show locator candidates
    Popup->>Trails: Send or use locator data when configured
